            "text_color": "text-dark",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Your Trusted Local Source for Bulk Grass Seed in Rifle, CO Since 1989",
            "text": "<p>Finding the right grass seed for high-altitude Colorado soil isn’t always easy. That’s why Rivendell Distribution offers blends tested for the region—drought-tolerant and suited for sun, slope, and soil. </p><p>Choose from<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Native+Grass\" target=\"_blank\"> native seed</a>,<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Pasture+Grass\" target=\"_blank\"> pasture mixes</a>,<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Turf+Grass\" target=\"_blank\"> turf grass</a>,<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Wildflowers+%26+Grass+Seed\" target=\"_blank\"> wildflowers, and reliable grass seed</a> for lawns or large-acre projects. We’re a family-run company with over 35 years of experience helping local ranchers, landscapers, and homeowners grow with confidence. Whether it’s bare spots, erosion control, or pasture renewal, we’ve got the right seed for your land—and we deliver straight to Rifle, CO and surrounding areas.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary btn--small",
            "bg_color": ""
          }
        }
